        <remarks>
          <para>Sets the refresh rate of a virtual display in frames per second.</para>
          <para>For best results, specify a divisor of the physical refresh rate, e.g., 30 or 60 on a 120hz display. If an arbitrary refresh rate is specified, the rate will be rounded up to a divisor of the physical display. If unset or zero, the virtual display will be refreshed at the physical display refresh rate.</para>
